(root / "script.js").write_text(r'''const menu = document.querySelector('.menu');
const nav = document.querySelector('nav');
menu.addEventListener('click', () => {
  nav.classList.toggle('open');
  menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', nav.classList.contains('open'));
  menu.textContent = nav.classList.contains('open') ? '×' : '☰';
});
nav.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => {
  nav.classList.remove('open'); menu.textContent = '☰'; menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');
}));
document.querySelector('#demo-form').addEventListener('submit', e => {
  e.preventDefault();
  const data = new FormData(e.currentTarget);
  const subject = encodeURIComponent('OMNI IT Solutions – demo request');
  const body = encodeURIComponent(`Name: ${data.get('name')}\nEmail: ${data.get('email')}\nCompany: ${data.get('company')}\nInterest: ${data.get('interest')}\nMessage: ${data.get('message') || 'Not provided'}`);
  const recipient = 'REPLACE-WITH-OMNI-EMAIL@example.com';
  if (recipient.includes('REPLACE-WITH')) {
    document.querySelector('#status').textContent = 'Prototype form ready. Replace the placeholder email in script.js before publishing.';
    return;
  }
  window.location.href = `mailto:${recipient}?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
  document.querySelector('#status').textContent = 'Your email app should open with the request prepared.';
});
''', encoding="utf-8")

(root / "README.md").write_text("""# OMNI IT Solutions — website prototype

A responsive static website concept using the OMNI Orbit logo supplied for this project.

## Preview locally
Open `index.html` in a modern browser. No installation or build tools are needed.

## Publish free with GitHub Pages
1. Sign in to GitHub and create a **public repository**, e.g. `omni-it-solutions-website`.
2. Upload **all files and folders inside this project** to the repository root. Keep `index.html`, `styles.css`, `script.js` and the `assets` folder together.
3. Open repository **Settings → Pages**.
4. Under **Build and deployment**, choose **Deploy from a branch**.
5. Select branch **main** and folder **/(root)**, then click **Save**.
6. Wait a minute or two. GitHub will display a public URL, usually `https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/omni-it-solutions-website/`.
7. Share that URL with your business partner. Later changes pushed to the repository update the website.

## Before public launch
- This is a concept preview, not a live software product catalogue. Product wording intentionally describes planned/intended capabilities.
- Replace `REPLACE-WITH-OMNI-EMAIL@example.com` in `script.js` with the company's enquiry email. Until then, the form displays a setup reminder.
- Connect the form to a form provider or backend before collecting real enquiries. GitHub Pages hosts static files; it does not process or store form submissions.
- Add confirmed company contact details and a POPIA-aligned privacy notice.
- Review product feature descriptions with both directors before publishing externally.

## Files
- `index.html` — page structure and content
- `styles.css` — responsive design
- `script.js` — mobile navigation and prototype form behaviour
- `assets/omni-logo.png` — OMNI Orbit logo
""", encoding="utf-8")

